OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticised after
OL,4,Asubmitting accounts 22 months late
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish council has been strongly
OL,7,Fcriticised by a spending watchdog for
OL,8,F"undermining transparency and
OL,9,Faccountability" after consistently
OL,10,Fmissing deadlines for reporting its
OL,11,Ffinances.
OL,13,FEast Dunbartonshire's 2023/24 audit was
OL,14,Fcompleted nearly two years after the
OL,15,Fstatutory deadline, something the
OL,16,FAccounts Commission said posed "a
OL,17,Fsignificant risk" to decision-making,
OL,18,Fsuch as deciding budgets without up-to
OL,19,Fdate information.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
