OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticised after
OL,4,Asubmitting accounts 22 months late
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the council made its 2026/27
OL,7,Fbudget earlier this year, it did so
OL,8,Fwith the most recent audited accounts
OL,9,Fdating back to 2022/23.
OL,11,FThe council said multiple factors
OL,12,Fincluding the introduction of a new
OL,13,Ffinancial management system had
OL,14,Fcontributed to the delays.
